          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"data-63-crows-never-forget-a-face-fishers-exact-test\">Data 6.3 \u2014 Crows Never Forget a Face (Fisher's exact test)</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Port of <code>UnitC/ch06/data-6.3-crows-never-forget-face-proportion.jl</code>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The book's counts are 158 of 602 crows scolded the caveman mask and 109 of 1031\nscolded the neutral mask (i.e. <code>no scold</code> = 444 and 922).  The original Julia\nsource wrote <code>444-158</code> / <code>922-109</code> (a bug); this port uses the correct counts.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
